                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a15ec907-cc02-4cd7-a42e-6845fc03fde8",
                                "sense_id": "c8ae6936-aee3-37f1-914b-6fc7d79289df",
                                "text": "― У вас, матушка, блинцы очень вкусны, ― сказал Чичиков, принимаясь за принесённые горячие.",
                                "translation": "“Your pancakes are indeed splendid,” said Chichikov, applying himself to the second consignment of fried dainties when they had arrived.",
